{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51675","headline":"感皇子远降见迎 · 钱弘俶","name":"感皇子远降见迎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千年遭遇觐真王，敢望青宫赐显扬。\n只合承华趋令德，岂宜中道拜元良。\n深思转觉乾坤大，力弱难胜雨露滂。\n早暮三思恩泰极，饱餐丰馔饱亲光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘俶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}